<div class="lead text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 !mb-9 text-xl">
  &ldquo;This Spring Festival, I uploaded my first Vocaloid original song on Bilibili and NetEase Cloud Music, officially beginning my journey as a producer under the name Aoki-P.&rdquo;
</div>

<p>The main purpose of uploading this song was to <del>try something new</del><span class="blackbox-container">
  <span class="blackbox-mask">flex my underage producer status 🤭</span>
</span>

<style>
