<p>&ldquo;One defining work per artist:
<meting-js
server="netease" type="playlist" id="13356030364">
</meting-js></p>
<h2 id="the-future-of-this-site">The Future of This Site</h2>
<p>Over the past year, academic pressures and boarding school life left little time for site maintenance, resulting in a nearly year-long hiatus. Starting in June, the site will resume <strong>regular updates</strong>. I&rsquo;ll share insights on music theory, arrangement, and mixing. After entering university, I&rsquo;ll transform this into a <strong>tech-focused blog</strong> documenting my learning journey. The &ldquo;Shuoshuo&rdquo; section will be retired—life updates will migrate to NetEase Cloud notes and Bilibili <span class="blackbox-container">
  <span class="blackbox-mask">BB Zone 🐕</span>
</span>

