<p>The music section will be reorganized, synced with my NetEase Cloud playlists, and gain a &ldquo;My Original Works&rdquo; category.</p>
<p>Backend dependencies like view counters (via Leancloud) will be phased out due to reliability issues. Considering alternative comment systems.</p>
<p>This trilingual site (Chinese/English/Japanese) will prioritize Chinese updates (with English sync). Japanese content resumes when my proficiency improves.</p>
<h2 id="about-icp-filing">About ICP Filing</h2>
<p>Having maintained ICP filing for a year, my conclusion: <span class="blackbox-container">
  <span class="blackbox-mask">Not worth the hassle</span>
</span>

<style>
.blackbox-mask {

  background: #000;
  color: #000;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0 -0.05em;
  letter-spacing: -0.05em;
