<p>PS: NetEase Cloud Musician&rsquo;s lifetime membership serves me well 🍉.</p>
<p>Yesterday, during Niconico&rsquo;s VOCALOID event in Japan, I uploaded the song to Niconico. Surprisingly, it received around 10 live comments! <img src="https://www.jukai.site/en/blogs/summary-outlook/74410387b988795452a8c1403fff2ed.jpg" alt="Niconico"  /><div class="lead text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400 !mb-9 text-xl">
  ↑They actually praised my lyrics! 😂
</div>
</p>
<h2 id="preview-of-next-post">Preview of Next Post</h2>
<p>Random musings like this—unlikely to attract attention elsewhere—are perfect for personal blogs. 😊</p>
<p>Next post might be a review? 🤔<span class="blackbox-container">
  <span class="blackbox-mask">&ldquo;June XX: My university prep list—laptop, peripherals, audio interface, MIDI controllers, studio headphones&hellip;&rdquo;</span>
</span>

